{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>And the meaning of יִצְף ד׳.</b> Like 'יְרֹאֵהַּ ד׳' (YHWH will see), and likewise 'צָפֹחַ נְתַתִּיךָ' (Ezekiel 3:17)." "For we are hidden from one another, each of us far from his fellow and unseen, but HaShem sees him." "And the meaning of what he said, 'return to Laban' — Jacob called it Mitzpah because he said to him, יִצְף ד׳.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:42.466659814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}